+
+**N3 — Premises.** The supplied canonical Gaussian state, native dictionary, dispersion, uniform stiffness and the parent's common filter remain explicit. The GNS implementation, Wick contraction and bounded-perturbation core arguments are mathematical ingredients justified in the text. No uniform gap for the unperturbed active spectrum is added.
+
