+
+**N5 — Actual coverage.** The 267 finite mathematical predicates cover hopping-path boundary independence, CAR commutators and dyadic weighted-tail arithmetic; resource guards are separate. Gaussian state convergence, norm-local cocycle convergence and the GNS resolvent identification are analytical, not numerical infinite-volume runs.
+
